    "created_at": "2019-10-11T17:14:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-10-11T17:14:07Z",
    "body": "Wouldnʼt the established [`An±B` microsyntax](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-syntax-3/#anb-microsyntax) make more sense to use?\n\n- `:heading(n < 3)` = `:heading(-n+3)`\n- `:heading(n > 3)` = `:heading(n-3)`\n- _n_ &in; {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6} for HTML",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/541148843/reactions",
